{"w":2400,"h":3209,"lines":[{"h":0.014981341139178372,"y":0.044834910380582405,"w":0.060384826660156252,"c":1,"x":0.098933800629141713,"t":"Test 3"},{"h":0.016199376947040545,"y":0.094392523248425841,"c":1,"x":0.099029128346023843,"t":"READING PASSAGE 3","w":0.30679611206054686},{"c":1,"h":0.022878472158841978,"y":0.12959066572794187,"t":"You should spend about 20 minutes on Questions 27-40, which are based on Reading","w":0.82353744506835935,"x":0.098924309846904826},{"w":0.17087378184000651,"h":0.017477178722155817,"c":1,"y":0.15261627894658147,"x":0.097087380806463605,"t":"Passage 3 below."},{"h":0.020348838259497848,"x":0.30873786854698476,"c":1,"t":"The case for mixed-ability classes","y":0.19186046457576555,"w":0.4135922241210937},{"t":"Picture this scene. It's an English literature","h":0.016043613707165116,"y":0.23395638618484693,"w":0.37087379455566405,"c":1,"x":0.097087374532642434},{"c":1,"x":0.096978152773394305,"w":0.40216664632161458,"y":0.2512777724956472,"t":"lesson in a UK school, and the teacher has just","h":0.020005895786939121},{"x":0.096857928358991457,"w":0.37131172180175775,"h":0.021248885775652315,"c":1,"t":"read an extract from Shakespeare's Romeo","y":0.26792791307031605},{"h":0.018962752559103402,"t":"and Juliet with a class of 15-year-olds. He's","y":0.28771474365872773,"c":1,"w":0.3769230397542318,"x":0.098916778309269704},{"t":"given some of the students copies of No Fear","y":0.30595951720234194,"x":0.098864982544607849,"w":0.38865598042805988,"h":0.019677692781727596,"c":1},{"y":0.32150406841741574,"w":0.3869525146484375,"h":0.022901229620722607,"x":0.098727715875013278,"c":1,"t":"Shakespeare, a kid-friendly translation of the"},{"t":"original. For three students, even these literacy","y":0.34274988364911174,"c":1,"x":0.098934018141582675,"h":0.019309251256449556,"w":0.40018925984700515},{"c":1,"t":"demands are beyond them. Another girl","w":0.3402142842610677,"x":0.098832280415087445,"y":0.36028979013857998,"h":0.020252138654762275},{"w":0.38473996480305989,"x":0.098882330007147065,"h":0.020066345072238256,"c":1,"t":"simply can't focus and he gives her pens and","y":0.37851469589102127},{"w":0.37333539326985676,"x":0.098743008464741419,"c":1,"t":"paper to draw with. The teacher can ask the","y":0.39659851446831962,"h":0.020879841742114436},{"c":1,"h":0.018876233799063891,"x":0.098916111020006955,"w":0.3827435557047526,"y":0.41676688883455348,"t":"No Fear group to identify the key characters"},{"t":"and maybe provide a tentative plot summary.","y":0.43478641764424286,"w":0.38664581298828127,"x":0.098900080774110111,"c":1,"h":0.019270982474924203},{"t":"He can ask most of the class about character","w":0.38087285359700523,"h":0.018418701266945225,"c":1,"x":0.09887313629527085,"y":0.45206026630661711},{"w":0.40615051269531255,"t":"development, and five of them might be able to","x":0.098859316667964658,"y":0.47041521049949342,"h":0.020378747387467255,"c":1},{"h":0.020268480057285543,"t":"support their statements with textual evidence.","c":1,"y":0.48879963919544778,"w":0.4003276062011718,"x":0.09882872416901331},{"x":0.098940133669559366,"y":0.50885395756792406,"w":0.35358573913574221,"h":0.01735857075248548,"c":1,"t":"Now two curious students are wondering"},{"y":0.52736833919490089,"w":0.40216766357421879,"t":"whether Shakespeare advocates living a life of","x":0.098937967577279642,"h":0.019125987733264571,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.39029126485188803,"t":"moderation or one of passionate engagement.","y":0.54641744574398188,"x":0.099029124781175704,"h":0.017536042709588306},{"w":0.40582524617513022,"x":0.099029124454714859,"h":0.017565928069973258,"c":1,"y":0.57994186034753636,"t":"As a teacher myself, I'd think my lesson would"},{"y":0.59738372097040793,"w":0.38640775044759118,"c":1,"h":0.018895348284474811,"t":"be going rather well if the discussion went as","x":0.10097087839270937},{"x":0.10068080338019891,"t":"described above. But wouldn't this kind of","y":0.61369447094101892,"w":0.36956601460774741,"h":0.021980071736273366,"c":1},{"t":"class work better if there weren't such a huge","c":1,"y":0.63517441869383806,"w":0.39029126485188803,"x":0.10097087238537673,"h":0.015988371899566145},{"w":0.40036972045898434,"h":0.020592822018442147,"x":0.10078125848774079,"y":0.65211396723492887,"c":1,"t":"gap between the top and the bottom? If we put"},{"h":0.021969742344175924,"c":1,"x":0.10076832516547668,"y":0.66973784897862321,"w":0.38098027547200525,"t":"all the kids who needed literacy support into"},{"t":"one class, and all the students who want to","w":0.36579126993815103,"y":0.686945150818008,"h":0.023993066092517945,"x":0.10253487894405482,"c":1},{"h":0.014685213677236963,"y":0.70930232528623205,"t":"discuss the virtue of moderation into another?","c":1,"x":0.10291261512539564,"w":0.39223302205403648},{"t":"The practice of 'streaming\", or 'tracking\",","x":0.10291261907933726,"y":0.74127907002927429,"h":0.0188953482844747,"w":0.36504854838053385,"c":1},{"h":0.020128850253571584,"y":0.75957487857649408,"c":1,"w":0.34782038370768231,"t":"involves separating students into classes","x":0.10086267796403348},{"h":0.019223249441366663,"y":0.77850716375914308,"t":"depending on their diagnosed levels of","x":0.10277138352024603,"c":1,"w":0.33624318440755208},{"y":0.79346548047201093,"w":0.37151512145996096,"h":0.025232412510571844,"t":"attainment. At a macro level, it requires the","c":1,"x":0.10257765232961087},{"y":0.81523503988957002,"w":0.34198549906412756,"c":1,"t":"establishment of academically selective","x":0.10278544793695213,"h":0.01903474754262191},{"x":0.10278528424785151,"t":"schools for the brightest students, and","h":0.018923845023752328,"y":0.83424501629430448,"w":0.32453849792480471,"c":1},{"y":0.84877329432870208,"c":1,"h":0.022390031666027821,"w":0.3675093841552734,"t":"comprehensive schools for the rest. Within","x":0.10261388982937437},{"h":0.025597115394853764,"c":1,"t":"schools, it means selecting students into a","y":0.86671566939899847,"x":0.10247695600328266,"w":0.36578618367513022},{"t":"'stream' of general ability, or 'sets' of subject-","x":0.1029126260632738,"y":0.88808139561746047,"w":0.39805824279785151,"c":1,"h":0.018895348284474811},{"t":"specific ability. The practice is intuitively","y":0.90712892645478671,"x":0.10269248986195606,"w":0.35571741739908852,"h":0.020347476376922802,"c":1},{"c":1,"x":0.10274856313145918,"y":0.92673918642110042,"w":0.33234235127766931,"t":"appealing to almost every stakeholder.","h":0.019607112563659101},{"y":0.96220930257767512,"x":0.10291262216410489,"h":0.014534883112922281,"w":0.029126211802164723,"c":1,"t":"70"},{"h":0.015988371899566145,"x":0.52427184640628322,"w":0.39417475382486977,"y":0.23110465125092339,"c":1,"t":"I have heard the mixed-ability model attacked"},{"t":"by way of analogy: a group hike. The fittest","c":1,"h":0.020785515330662196,"x":0.52601369400689013,"y":0.24875704614223548,"w":0.37713600158691407},{"y":0.26884735186799302,"h":0.017489857539952469,"x":0.52427184936351179,"w":0.39805824279785162,"t":"in the group take the lead and set a brisk pace,","c":1},{"t":"only to have to stop and wait every 20 minutes.","y":0.28406811457356829,"c":1,"x":0.52590323390386495,"w":0.40631312052408852,"h":0.02377889757958529},{"y":0.30414873521894026,"w":0.40605860392252613,"t":"This is frustrating, and their enthusiasm wanes.","c":1,"h":0.01948289722668417,"x":0.52607311620491881},{"x":0.52621358845642729,"w":0.35533981323242203,"h":0.019035716665868119,"t":"Meanwhile, the slowest ones are not only","y":0.32398753886482212,"c":1},{"y":0.34143302192190417,"t":"embarrassed but physically struggling to keep","x":0.5262135937089244,"w":0.39417475382486977,"h":0.019032093891844903,"c":1},{"y":0.36132029862070947,"w":0.40803993225097657,"x":0.52608656883941629,"t":"up. What's worse, they never get a long enough","h":0.020562102415851324,"c":1},{"w":0.40216522216796868,"c":1,"t":"break. They honestly just want to quit. Hiking,","y":0.37794566131518548,"x":0.52609194274138249,"h":0.021472305820738335},{"c":1,"y":0.39825734115516997,"x":0.52597753492561317,"h":0.019798512919298239,"t":"they feel, is not for them.","w":0.21985087076822918},{"x":0.52793511135117643,"y":0.4310103759945314,"w":0.38297749837239581,"h":0.022458797229041982,"t":"Mixed-ability classes bore students, frustrate","c":1},{"h":0.018221007255007637,"c":1,"t":"parents and burn out teachers. The brightest","x":0.52609241468812651,"y":0.45130821796559228,"w":0.37693593343098952},{"y":0.46947040504577142,"w":0.4213592274983724,"h":0.019003115264797588,"c":1,"t":"ones will never summit Mount Qomolangma, and","x":0.52815533768404632},{"t":"the stragglers won't enjoy the lovely stroll in the","y":0.48671506944924614,"w":0.40613011678059896,"c":1,"x":0.52799632878100167,"h":0.021087491995077645},{"h":0.022332701876155991,"t":"park they are perhaps more suited to. Individuals","c":1,"x":0.52592852500726917,"w":0.41027132670084643,"y":0.50537923883739377},{"c":1,"w":0.40970873514811201,"x":0.52621359365706588,"y":0.52616279057501514,"h":0.017450916729983557,"t":"suffer at the demands of the collective, mediocrity"},{"t":"prevails. So: is learning like hiking?","y":0.54451906826378216,"x":0.52601783926640777,"w":0.30523969014485675,"h":0.019524008017091421,"c":1},{"y":0.5784883719743259,"x":0.5281553415132979,"w":0.39417475382486988,"h":0.017461783863673697,"c":1,"t":"The current pedagogical paradigm is arguably"},{"w":0.38880650838216158,"t":"that of constructivism, which emerged out of","y":0.59579036856124568,"h":0.020785726862161624,"x":0.52795149679959297,"c":1},{"y":0.61619937694122651,"x":0.52815534455123614,"c":1,"t":"the work of psychologist Lev Vygotsky. In the","w":0.39805824279785151,"h":0.017521553396064538},{"t":"1930s, Vygotsky emphasised the importance of","x":0.52985529454207347,"y":0.63243837063288688,"w":0.40634981791178382,"h":0.022231896421248343,"c":1},{"t":"targeting a student's specific 'zone of proximal","h":0.024000639633226184,"x":0.52790542339865032,"w":0.40441739400227872,"c":1,"y":0.64952849209995744},{"c":1,"w":0.38868507385253903,"h":0.021649015432577579,"t":"development' (ZPD). This is the gap between","x":0.52992147763159136,"y":0.66951884840602216},{"w":0.34786165873209629,"y":0.69067894145718933,"t":"what they can achieve only with support","x":0.52996473207320949,"c":1,"h":0.019119376779716757},{"w":0.35174636840820306,"t":"- teachers, textbooks, worked examples,","x":0.52798546065189278,"y":0.70853292498851028,"c":1,"h":0.021074058556482478},{"y":0.72712311013270448,"w":0.39640317281087245,"x":0.529942158444623,"c":1,"h":0.020031253422532092,"t":"parents and so on - and what they can achieve"},{"t":"independently. The purpose of teaching is","x":0.52996224479629117,"c":1,"h":0.0192525929008317,"w":0.35948402404785162,"y":0.7464783806097075},{"w":0.35953979492187504,"h":0.020209158543857075,"c":1,"x":0.52993656158356806,"t":"to provide and then gradually remove this","y":0.76440883259891068},{"t":"'scaffolding' until they are autonomous. If we","y":0.78343023282750857,"w":0.39417475382486977,"x":0.53009708903722341,"c":1,"h":0.018895348284474811},{"y":0.80214939197454915,"h":0.019912219418914967,"x":0.52997533413578124,"c":1,"t":"accept this model, it follows that streaming","w":0.3730515034993489},{"y":0.8215596011017533,"c":1,"h":0.015948281332711201,"w":0.34389673868815107,"t":"students with similar ZPDs would be an","x":0.5299829784270762},{"t":"efficient and effective solution. And that","h":0.017516119532124619,"y":0.84011627893685936,"c":1,"w":0.34757280985514316,"x":0.53009709036493524},{"y":0.85887850494830154,"c":1,"t":"forcing everyone on the same hike - regardless","w":0.40388348897298176,"h":0.017574983519557108,"x":0.53009709056040721},{"t":"of aptitude - would be madness.","x":0.53186375380821471,"y":0.87646620426399424,"w":0.27988413492838538,"h":0.019161098397038057,"c":1},{"t":"Despite all this, there is limited empirical","x":0.53188347900261701,"w":0.3556593322753907,"h":0.020114847581334527,"y":0.91107708862420078,"c":1},{"w":0.37710962931315117,"c":1,"y":0.92863015619182343,"t":"evidence to suggest that streaming results in","x":0.53184101994670974,"h":0.021626601412288893}]}